cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: SRL-Agent
abstract: >
  A conversational AI interview tool for assessing self-regulated learning
  strategies of students. The system guides learners through a structured
  interview, detects strategies across study contexts, collects frequency
  ratings, and generates a personalised summary based on Zimmerman &
  Martinez-Pons' Self-Regulated Learning Interview Schedule.
